  "description": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"73\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"71\">Nickelodeon Trefl Puzzel Paw Patrol 9-in-1 | Nieuw in Seal | €10,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"280\">Laat kinderen spelenderwijs genieten met deze <strong data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"170\">Nickelodeon Trefl Paw Patrol 9-in-1 puzzelset</strong>. De set is <strong data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"206\">nieuw en nog geseald</strong>, dus ongebruikt en direct klaar om cadeau te geven of zelf mee te spelen.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"285\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"304\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"477\"><strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"318\">Product:</strong> Trefl Paw Patrol Puzzelset<br data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"348\"><strong data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"366\">Merk/Licentie:</strong> Nickelodeon – Paw Patrol<br data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"394\"><strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"413\">Aantal puzzels:</strong> 9-in-1<br data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"423\"><strong data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"432\">Type:</strong> Kinderpuzzel<br data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"448\"><strong data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"461\">Toestand:</strong> Nieuw in seal</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"482\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"497\">Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"741\">\r\n<li data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"548\">\r\n<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"548\">9 verschillende Paw Patrol puzzels in één set</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"602\">\r\n<p data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"602\">Bevordert concentratie en motorische vaardigheden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"661\">\r\n<p data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"661\">Vrolijke Paw Patrol afbeeldingen, ideaal voor kinderen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"705\">\r\n<p data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"705\">Nieuw en ongebruikt, perfect als cadeau</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"741\">\r\n<p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"741\">Betrouwbare kwaliteit van Trefl</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"746\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"757\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"769\"><strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"769\">€10,99</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"774\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"800\">Ophalen of Verzenden</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"898\">Afhalen bij <strong data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"843\">Used Products Spijkenisse</strong><br data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"846\">Verzending mogelijk, veilig verpakt en snel geleverd</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"1109\"> </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1381\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Paw Patrol puzzel<br data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1157\">Trefl puzzel 9 in 1<br data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1179\">Nickelodeon Paw Patrol<br data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1204\">Kinder puzzel Paw Patrol<br data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1231\">Paw Patrol speelgoed<br data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1254\">Puzzel nieuw in seal<br data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1277\">Cadeau kinderen puzzel<br data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1302\">Used Products Spijkenisse<br data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1330\">Speelgoed Paw Patrol<br data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1353\">Educatief speelgoed kinderen</p>",
